reusable and PRs are automatically GPU-tested/scored. Input: consent
video + script. Output: cloned-voice, identity-preserved talking-head
scene. Experiment: use one canonical synthetic host asset and compare
identity drift/latency/cost against our current avatar path. Potential
replacement: hand-built glue around identity + voice + lip-sync.
License/commercial terms need repo-level verification before
production.

